apon/sword/longsword[/color]: Johannes Sjölund (wulax), bluecarrot16 (OGA-BY 3.0, CC-BY-SA 3.0)\n\n[b][color=#e8b14a]Town art credits[/color][/b]\nThe town map (art/town) is laid out by tools/town_compose.py from these free art packs:\n[color=#aab3c8]LPC Revised[/color]: (github.com/ElizaWy/LPC, OGA-BY 3.0) terrain, cliffs, trees, plants and tilled soil by Lanea Zimmerman (Sharm) and Eliza Wyatt (DeathsDarling), with plants by Hyptosis and wildflowers by Demetrius. Brick House A and B, Paneled House A, doors, the fountain, shop signs, the plain fence, lamps, barrels, chests and crates by Lanea Zimmerman and Eliza Wyatt. Anvils and coal by BlueCarrot16. Hay by Lanea Zimmerman.\n[color=#aab3c8][LPC] City outside[/color]: (opengameart.org/content/lpc-city-outside, CC-BY-SA 3.0 / GPL 3.0) by Reemax (Tuomo Untinen), with art by Sharm, daneeklu, Hyptosis, Johann C, William.Thompsonj and wulax. The market stall, banners, the well and planters.\n[color=#aab3c8]LPC Tile Atlas[/color]: (opengameart.org/content/lpc-tile-atlas, CC-BY-SA 3.0 / GPL 3.0) from the Liberated Pixel Cup base assets by Lanea Zimmerman (Sharm) and others. The gravestones.\n[color=#aab3c8]The bounty board[/color]: drawn by tools/town_compose.py in the LPC palette.\n\n[b][color=#e8b14a]Potion and scroll icons[/color][/b]\nPotions: the CC0 Dungeon Crawl Stone Soup set from \"cc0 potion icons\" (opengameart.org/content/cc0-potion-icons), collected by AntumDeluge. Scrolls, the chest, horn, key and book: Dungeon Crawl Stone Soup tiles (opengameart.org/content/dungeon-crawl-32x32-tiles, CC0). The backpack was drawn for Solaria.\n\n[b][color=#e8b14a]Monster and pet art[/color][/b]\nEvery monster, boss, Calamity and companion: Dungeon Crawl Stone Soup tiles (opengameart.org/content/dungeon-crawl-32x32-tiles, CC0), by the DCSS artists (github.com/crawl/tiles/blob/master/ARTISTS.md). Recolored, cleaned up and outlined for Solaria by tools/dcss_monsters.py. Torches, statues, chests and other room props are Dungeon Crawl Stone Soup tiles too (CC0).\n\n[b][color=#e8b14a]Dungeon rooms[/color][/b]\nWalls, floors and ceilings: Tiny Texture Packs 1, 2 and 3 by Screaming Brain Studios (opengameart.org/content/tiny-texture-pack-1, CC0), shrunk and recolored into pixel art by tools/fp_textures.py. The doors were drawn for Solaria.\n\n[b][color=#e8b14a]Effects[/color][/b]
Hit and spell effects were drawn for Solaria by tools/make_fx.gd (CC0)."
